        {
          "line_num": 1,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ስለ ፡ ተጠሩ ፡ በሰማዕትነት ፡ በሞቱ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 2,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሰዎች ፡ ደም ፡ የመጣ ፡ ፍዳ ፡ ባንቺ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 3,
          "margin_tag": "፩",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪፩ ፡ ወእምድኅረ ፡ ዝንቱ ፡ ተሰምዐ ፡ ቃል ፡ ዐቢይ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 4,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እምሰማይ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 5,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከዚህ ፡ በኋላ ፡ ከሰማይ ፡ ቃል ፡ ተሰማ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 6,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ከመ ፡ ዘብዙኅ ፡ ሰብእ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 7,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እንደ ፡ ገበያተኛ ፡ እንደ ፡ ሠርገኛ ፡ እንደ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 8,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ልቅሶኛ ፡ እንደ ፡ ድሎተኛ ፡ ያለ ፡ ቃል ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 9,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ተሰማ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወይብሉ ፡ ሃሌ ፡ ሉያ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ስብሐት ፡ ለዘሀሎ ፡ ስብሐት ፡ ለቀዳማዊ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 12,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሰብሑ ፡ እግዚአ ፡ እያሉ ፡ ያመሰግናሉ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 13,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪እስመ ፡ ስብሐት ፡ ወፍርቃን ፡ ወኃይል ፡ ለአምላክነ ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 14,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ኀይል ፡ ሥልጣን ፡ ምስጋና ፡ ለፈጣሪያ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 15,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ችን ፡ የሚገባ ፡ ስለ ፡ ሆነ ፡ ም ፡ ፲፩ ፡ ፲፭ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 16,
          "margin_tag": "፪",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪፪ ፤ እስመ ፡ ጽድቅ ፡ ወርትዕ ፡ ኵነኔሁ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 17,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ፍርዱ ፡ ጽድቅ ፡ ርትዕ ፡ ነውና ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 18,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪እስመ ፡ ኰነና ፡ ለዐባይ ፡ ዘማ ፡ እንተ ፡ አማሰነት ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 19,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ምድረ ፡ በዝሙታ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 20,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አብነት ፡ ሆና ፡ ሌላውን ፡ ኃጢአት ፡ ባሠ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 21,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ራች ፡ በቤተ ፡ አይሁድ ፡ ፈርዶባታልና ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 22,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወተበቀለ ፡ ደመ ፡ ኵሎሙ ፡ አግብርቲሁ ፡ እምእዴሃ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 23,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "(ተቀበለ ፡ ይላል) ፡ የወዳጆቹን ፡ ደም ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 24,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከእጅዋ፡ ተቀብሎ፡ አፍሷልና ። አንድም ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 25,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ተበቀለም፡ ይላል፡ በእጅዋ፡ የፈሰሰ፡ የወዳ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 26,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጆቹን ፡ ደም ፡ አስቦ ፡ ፈርዶባታልና ፡ ም ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 27,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፲፮ ፡ ፮ ። ም ፡ ፮ ፡ ፲ ። ዘዳግ ፡ ፴፪ ፡ ፵፫ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 28,
          "margin_tag": "፫",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪፫ ፤ ወይብሉ ፡ ዳግመ ፡ ሃሌ ፡ ሉያ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 29,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዳግመኛም፡ ስብሐት፡ ለዘሀሎ፡ ስብሐት ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 30,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ለቀዳማዊ ፡ ሰብሑ ፡ እግዚአ ፡ እያሉ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 31,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ያመሰግናሉ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "column_index": 2,
      "lines": [
        {
          "line_num": 1,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ደረሰ ፡ ም ፡ ፮ ፡ ፲ ። ም ፡ ፲፮ ፡ ፮ና ፡ ፲፱ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 2,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፪ ። ማቴ ፡ ፳፫ ፡ ፴፭ ፡ ፴፮ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 3,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "chapter_title",
          "text": "ምዕራፍ ፡ ፲፱ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 4,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወዐርገ ፡ ጢሳ ፡ ዘለዓለመ ፡ ዓለም ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 5,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "የዘለዓለም ፡ ጢስ ፡ ወጣ ፡ አለ ፡ ሦስት ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 6,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "መቶ ፡ ክንድ ፡ እየተመዘዘ ፡ ሲወጣ ፡ ያየ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 7,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዋል ፡ በነቢብ ፡ በገቢር ፡ በሐልዮ ፡ በሠ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 8,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሩት ፡ እንደ ፡ ተፈረደባቸው ፡ ለማጠየቅ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 9,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ኢሳ ፡ ፴፬ ፡ ፲ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": "፬",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪፬ ፤ ወሰገዱ ፡ እልክቱ ፡ ዕሥራ ፡ ወአርባዕቱ ፡ ሊቃ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ናት ፡ ወእልክቱኒ ፡ አርባዕቱ ፡ እንስሳሁ ፡ ለእግዚ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 12,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አብሔር ፡ ዘይነብር ፡ ዲበ ፡ መንበሩ ፡ ቅዱስ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 13,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ኻያ ፡ አራቱ ፡ ሊቃናት ፡ አራቱ ፡ ኪሩ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 14,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቤል ፡ በመንበሩ ፡ ላይ ፡ ተቀምጦ ፡ ላለ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 15,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አንድም ፡ በጌትነት ፡ ላለ ፡ ለእግዚአብ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 16,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሔር፡ ይብጅ፡ ያድርግ፡ ብለው፡ ሰገዱለት ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 17,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወይብሉ ፡ አሜን ፡ ሃሌ ፡ ሉያ ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 18,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አሜን ፡ እያሉ ፡ ስብሐት ፡ ለዘሀሎ ፡ ስብ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 19,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሐት ፡ ለቀዳማዊ ፡ ሰብሑ ፡ እግዚአ ፡ እያ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 20,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሉ ፡ ሰገዱለት ፡ ም ፡ ፭ ፡ ፲፬ ። መዝ ፡ ፻፮ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 21,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፵፰ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 22,
          "margin_tag": "፭",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪፭ ፤ ወወፅአ ፡ ቃል ፡ እምሰማይ ፡ እምውስተ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 23,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "መንበሩ ፡ ዘይብል ፡ ሰብሑ ፡ ለአምላክነ ፡ ኵልክሙ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 24,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አግብርቲሁ ፡ ወእለ ፡ ትፈርህዎ ፡ ንኡስክሙ ፡ ወዐ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 25,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቢይክሙ ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 26,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በሰማይ ፡ ካለ ፡ ከመንበሩ ፡ ወዳጆቹ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 27,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሁላችሁም ፡ ታላቁም ፡ ታናሹም ፡ ለፈጣ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 28,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሪያችን ፡ ምስጋና ፡ አቅርቡ ፡ የሚል ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 29,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቃል ፡ ተሰማ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 30,
          "margin_tag": "፮",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪፮ ፤ ወእምዝ ፡ ሰማዕኩ ፡ ቃለ ፡ ከመ ፡ ዘብዙኅ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 31,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሰብእ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
